<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>stylish — salon appointment booking (Kiosk demo)</title>
  <!-- Machine-readable affordance: assistants discover the Kiosk surface here. -->
  <link rel="kiosk" href="https://kiosk.tech/skill.md">
  <style>
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;color:#241826;background:#faf5fa;line-height:1.5}
    header{background:#7a2b63;color:#fff;padding:0 32px;height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.5px}
    .logo span{color:#ffb9e6}
    .wrap{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
    .hero{margin:44px auto 0;text-align:center}
    .hero h1{font-size:30px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px}
    .hero p{font-size:17px;color:#5f4a5c}
    .tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#7a2b63;background:#f5e0f0;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 13px}

    /* ── Live activity stat cards ─────────────────────────────────────── */
    .stats-h{margin:44px auto 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#987a92;text-align:center}
    .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:14px}
    .stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid #eeddec;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 16px;text-align:center}
    .stat .n{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#7a2b63;line-height:1}
    .stat .l{margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#6f556b;font-weight:600}

    /* ── Human sign-in line ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .signin-note{margin:40px auto 0;font-size:14px;color:#5f4a5c;text-align:center}
    .signin-note a{color:#7a2b63;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}
    .signin-note a:hover{text-decoration:underline}

    /* ── Kiosk banner (subtle, assistant-facing hint) ─────────────────── */
    .kiosk-banner{margin:14px auto 0;padding:10px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #eeddec;font-size:12.5px;color:#987a92;text-align:center}
    .kiosk-banner a{color:#7a2b63;text-decoration:none}
    .kiosk-banner a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
    footer{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#ab8fa5;padding:34px 0 40px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">styl<span>ish</span></div>
    <nav style="font-size:13px;opacity:.9">salon booking · Combette on Park</nav>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Book my haircut for Thursday.</h1>
      <p>A hair-styling salon that takes appointments over the Kiosk wire — customers book, and salon staff (owner / stylist) manage the calendar, roles inherited by their assistant.</p>
      <span class="tag">Kiosk demo operator · capabilities [schema, query, run]</span>
    </section>

    <h3 class="stats-h">Live activity</h3>
    <section class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n"><%= @appointments_booked %></div>
        <div class="l">Appointments booked</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n"><%= @upcoming %></div>
        <div class="l">Upcoming appointments</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n"><%= @staff_on_book %></div>
        <div class="l">Staff on the book</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n"><%= @salons %></div>
        <div class="l">Salons</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="signin-note">Salon staff? <a href="/users/sign_in">Sign in</a> to manage the calendar and approve assistant links.</p>
    <p class="kiosk-banner">🤖 This service speaks Kiosk — a customer's AI assistant can discover and transact here directly. <a href="/.well-known/kiosk.json">/.well-known/kiosk.json</a></p>
  </div>

  <footer>stylish — demo provider — powered by Kiosk</footer>
</body>
</html>
